        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo LP-312-EBF, Aluminum Entry Door Latch Guards</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your aluminum storefront entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this 12\" high steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis security door latch protector is 12\" high and designed specifically for aluminum store front doors with Adams Rite type <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\"><b>Mortise Deadlatch</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise Deadbolt</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\"><b>Mortise Hookbolt</b></a>. The mounting bolts go through the door and are attached on the inside with the included EBF nuts for a professional appearance. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-LP-312-EBF_size.gif?v=1704354675\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo LP-312-EBF Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor outswinging doors. Fits over lock cylinder so the <a href=\"/products/1-inch-brass-mortise-cylinder-lock-for-storefront-door-th1100-bc\"><b>Mortise Lock Cylinder</b></a> does not require removal when installing the latch protection plate. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo LP-312-EBF Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Sex bolt and nuts.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LP-312-EBF.pdf?v=1704262301\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo LP-312-EBF Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Outswinging Aluminum Entry Door Latch Guard, Don-Jo LP-312-EBF",
                "description": "Don-Jo LP-312-EFB Aluminum Entrance Door Latch Guard. This door latch protector is 12 inches high and designed specifically for store front doors with a Mortise Deadlatch or deadbolt. The mounting bolts go through the door and are attached on the inside with the included sex nuts for a secure, professional appearance.  Fits over lock cylinder so the Mortise Lock Cylinder does not require removal when installing.",
